&lt;p&gt;I use a text to diagram tool called &lt;a href="https://plantuml.com"&gt;PlantUML&lt;/a&gt;. It's perfect!
Now, I want to use it with my hugo site, through a short code. So, I I type a
code like below, I should see out like as the image.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- more --&gt;
