&lt;p&gt;Map of India, drawn form C Code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!--excerpt--&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Going through social networks, I stumbled upon this code. It didn't make much sense to me, except for the fact that there were 2 loops doing something with a large string. But when I compiled it (with a tiny modification), it gave a great result. Here's code and result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt; 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
