&lt;p&gt;List of Books that I have been recommended and I would recommend&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OpenVPN on (Rooted) SGS2</title><link>https://yogendra.github.io/2012/01/02/openvpn-on-rooted-sgs2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Jan 2012 00:59:22 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yogendra.github.io/2012/01/02/openvpn-on-rooted-sgs2/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Since mid-last year, I started using a VPN service. Good for me, my VPN provider has both &lt;a href="https://goo.gl/8LTMa"&gt;L2TP&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://goo.gl/jEe4k"&gt;OpenVPN&lt;/a&gt; services. L2TP is very easy to configure on Android phones (newer ones). But I find it unstable (may be my provider's problem). So, I prefer OpenVPN as its stable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>